# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and the working tree.
# The project is Windows-only but every source file is authored in UTF-8/LF;
# .ps1 scripts, Go sources and reporters all work with LF endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The DSH plugin package vendors a prebuilt overlay binary. It must be stored
# byte-for-byte: a single re-encoded byte breaks the SHA-256 that
# packages/dsh-ai-terminal-pet/scripts/vendor.mjs and -VerifyOnly rely on.
*.exe binary
